      "topic": "Chapter/section label not established; Varshesha indications",
      "text": "The 1907 Hindi commentary describes annual indications for the Sun when it is Varshesha (year lord), distinguishing strong, middling, and weak conditions. It also says natal strength modifies how fully the annual indication manifests.",
