      "traditionId": "TAJIKA",
      "topic": "Muntha phala",
      "text": "The commentary associates Muntha in the 3rd and 5th houses with favorable traditional indications, and in the 4th and 6th with challenging indications. Its house-specific descriptions are preserved as tradition-attributed themes, not factual forecasts.",
